<title>UK: INSIGHT-Gold seen slipping further, $310 possible.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Gold seen slipping further, $310 possible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   324.25/4.75 *  310.00 * 326.00 *    26 * 339.84 * 348.59</p>
<p> SILVER   4.54/4.56 *    4.40 *   4.90 *    51 *   4.68 *   4.73</p>
<p> PLAT   419.00/3.00 *  410.00 * 435.00 *    51 * 418.50 * 421.93</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 7---------------</p>
<p>Gold prices may weaken again on Monday with $310 per ounce a possibility after the market plunged to 12-year lows late last week, technical analysts said.</p>
<p>Support was technically possible at $310, but the overwhelmingly bearish sentiment in the market could deter buyers.</p>
